        <activityName xml:lang="en">CEM III, A cement, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: CEM III, A cement, at plant
The dataset describes the production of cement (CEM III-A) in Switzerland .\nTechnology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Bindemittel\nUVEK 2022 source file:551-Zement-Klinker_v0.13_UVEK2021._CEM III-B.xml\n\n
UUID: f29dd8cc-f4df-3908-9727-95545a84d739
From cradle, i.e. including all upstream activities. As source of gypsum, waste gypsum from flue gas treatment is assumed.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from the association of the swiss cement industry (cemsuisse) representing average production in Switzerland 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f29dd8cc-f4df-3908-9727-95545a84d739.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
